messages.content:
{"response":"I understand the impact this delay is causing. Per our policy, compensation for a delayed flight is only available if you change to a different flight or cancel the reservation. Because you’re remaining on this flight, I’m not able to issue any compensation, refunds to original payment, bonus miles, lounge access, meal/drink vouchers, or refunds of seat upgrade/bag fees.

If you change your mind and prefer to change or cancel due to the delay, I can provide a travel certificate of $50 per passenger after completing that change or cancellation. Certificates are the only compensation method available for delays.

I can, however, provide the latest operational details. Please confirm the flight date for HAT045 (Phoenix to Seattle), and I’ll pull the current estimated departure time and the stated reason for the delay. I can also share a written confirmation of the delay details here that you can forward to your employer."}

